sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (You)
    participant Agent as AI Agent (Claude/Copilot/Gemini)
    participant Portal as Questrade Portal
    participant Engine as QuestradeDataEngine.py
    participant KC as macOS Keychain
    participant Cache as .questrade_cache (encrypted)
    participant API as Questrade OAuth2 API
    participant Backend as Node.js Backend (port 3001)

    Note over User, Portal: One-Time Setup (or when token expires)
    User->>Portal: Generate One-Week App Token
    Portal-->>User: Returns one-week token string
    User->>Agent: "Here is my token: <token>"

    Note over Agent, Cache: Agent handles everything from here
    Agent->>API: POST /oauth2/token?refresh_token=<one_week_token> (with -d '')
    API-->>Agent: refresh_token + access_token (JSON)
    Agent->>Engine: --seed "<refresh_token>" --cache-dir investment_screener/backend/
    Engine->>KC: Get or create AES-256 master key
    KC-->>Engine: Master key (hardware-backed)
    Engine->>Cache: Write AES-256-GCM encrypted token
    Agent->>Backend: POST /api/portfolio/sync-questrade
    Backend-->>Agent: { success: true }

    Note over Cache, API: Every Subsequent Sync (fully automatic)
    Backend->>Cache: Read encrypted token
    Cache-->>Backend: Ciphertext + Nonce
    Backend->>KC: Decrypt with master key
    Backend->>API: POST /oauth2/token (current refresh_token)
    API-->>Backend: New access_token + New refresh_token
    Backend->>Cache: Atomic write of NEW refresh_token (encrypted)
    Backend->>API: Fetch portfolio data with access_token
